{"title":"Elainegibbs26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"background:#ffdddd; width:60%; border:2px solid #aa0000; margin:auto; text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">\n<p><b>This page has been proposed for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Deletion_policy\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Deletion policy\">deletion</a>.</b> Reason: <b>Not Math</b>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #aa0000;\" />\n<p><small>\n<b>Note to sysops:</b> Before deleting, please review: • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Elainegibbs26\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Elainegibbs26\">What links here</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talk:Elainegibbs26&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Talk:Elainegibbs26 (page does not exist)\">Discussion page</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Elainegibbs26&amp;action=history\">Edit history</a>\n</small>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Среди проверенных решений на рынке выделяется компания Awalab — наркозные аппараты, которые она поставляет, зарекомендовали себя как надёжные устройства для ингаляционной анестезии и искусственной вентиляции лёгких <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://awalab.ru/catalog/anesteziologiya-i-reanimatsiya/narkoznye-apparaty/\">https://awalab.ru/catalog/anesteziologiya-i-reanimatsiya/narkoznye-apparaty/</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083330\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 723/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion e